eedBasic computer familiarityAround 8 hours a week for four monthsA laptop that can play HD videoNo prior editing experience [ counsellor photo ]Not sure you qualify?A counsellor reviews your background and tells you honestly. Free, no pressure.Check my eligibility → The full course Curriculum, projects and tools. Week-by-week structure, what past learners built, and every tool you\'ll touch hands-on. Curriculum 10 · Projects 3 · Tools 12. Curriculum 10 Projects 3 Tools 12 M01The grammar of the cut14 hrs · Wk 1-2", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Why edits work: rhythm and motivationShot types and coverageContinuity and its violationsWatching like an editorExercise: recut a scene three ways"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I learn editing on a normal laptop?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes for this course: we cut in HD proxies, a professional workflow that runs on modest machines. You will also learn the optimisation habits that make bigger projects possible later."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Premiere or DaVinci: which do you teach?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Both, deliberately. Premiere is the industry default employers list; Resolve owns colour and is free, the freelancer\'s edge. Two-NLE fluency is a hiring advantage we build in."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will AI video tools replace editors?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "They replace mechanical cutting. Story rhythm, taste and client judgement remain human, and AI multiplies the output of editors who have them. The AI-pipeline module exists to put you on the right side of that shift."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What does a video editor earn?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Studio and agency juniors start between Rs 2.5 and 4 lakh. Freelance rewrites the math: reel packages, wedding films and creator retainers commonly out-earn salaries within two years for consistent editors."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you cover wedding and event editing for Kerala\'s market?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, with its real economics: storytelling structure, turnaround discipline and pricing. It is a significant income line for editors here and we treat it professionally, not as an afterthought."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will I have a showreel at the end?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, and it is the capstone: cut from your three delivered projects, sound-designed and premiered to a panel. Editing is hired on reels; the entire course walks backwards from yours."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support."}}]}'
