<section class="sec" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why video editing, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Video is how India consumes everything now, and every brand, creator and business needs more of it than they can produce. Editors who cut fast, tell stories and drive AI tools have more work than hours, from Kochi weddings to global brand reels.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>90%</b><span class="t">Of internet traffic is video</span><p>Reels, ads, courses, podcasts: everything renders through an editor.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>Creator</b><span class="t">Economy pays editors</span><p>Every serious creator outsources editing; retainers are the norm.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>AI</b><span class="t">Rewrites the pipeline</span><p>Script-to-cut AI multiplies output; directed by trained editors.</p></div>
</div>
<h3 class="reveal" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:44px">Why it is a smart move for you</h3>
<div class="diff-grid" style="margin-top:22px">
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-cap"></use></svg></span><b>Story first, software second</b><p>Cutting rhythm and narrative are the career; tools are learnable in weeks.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chart"></use></svg></span><b>Two-NLE fluency</b><p>Premiere for the industry default, Resolve for colour and the free-agent edge.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-globe"></use></svg></span><b>AI pipeline built in</b><p>Auto-cuts, captions, voice and generative video, directed with taste.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shield"></use></svg></span><b>Reels to films</b><p>Vertical social, ads, weddings and short films: Kerala's actual demand mix.</p></div>
