<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>Can I learn editing on a normal laptop? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes for this course: we cut in HD proxies, a professional workflow that runs on modest machines. You will also learn the optimisation habits that make bigger projects possible later.</div></details>
<details><summary>Premiere or DaVinci: which do you teach? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both, deliberately. Premiere is the industry default employers list; Resolve owns colour and is free, the freelancer's edge. Two-NLE fluency is a hiring advantage we build in.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will AI video tools replace editors? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">They replace mechanical cutting. Story rhythm, taste and client judgement remain human, and AI multiplies the output of editors who have them. The AI-pipeline module exists to put you on the right side of that shift.</div></details>
<details><summary>What does a video editor earn? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Studio and agency juniors start between Rs 2.5 and 4 lakh. Freelance rewrites the math: reel packages, wedding films and creator retainers commonly out-earn salaries within two years for consistent editors.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you cover wedding and event editing for Kerala's market? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes, with its real economics: storytelling structure, turnaround discipline and pricing. It is a significant income line for editors here and we treat it professionally, not as an afterthought.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will I have a showreel at the end? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes, and it is the capstone: cut from your three delivered projects, sound-designed and premiered to a panel. Editing is hired on reels; the entire course walks backwards from yours.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support, real introductions and freelance guidance, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
